     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear users,<div>how can I define just ONE of the regressions in my SEM model (indeed is a path analyses, no LV&#39;s) to be logit (or by using probit if logit is still not developed in lavaan)?</div><div>This is my model</div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"color:red;font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:12pt\">Model2&lt;- &#39;Myc~f*\r\nrodens+g*fbrdn</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   &lt;- I want this to be a logit regression, and I realize that I cannot use the family = binomial as in glm</font></span><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">fbrdn ~b* sand +d* GApBinary +e*rodens<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">rodens ~c*GApBinary<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">GApBinary ~a*sand<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">fit2 &lt;- sem(DesiredBestModel2, data =\r\ndata2)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\">summary(fit2)</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:red\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Garamond,serif\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks in advance</font></span></p></div></div>"
